### Variables de entorno locales
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 1. Root Endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Health Check (Liveness)
# Utilizado por el Application Load Balancer (ALB) en ECS
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz/liveness
Accept: application/json

### 3. Crear una nueva QR para delivery (Draft para cuando armemos el POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "cust_98234",
  "items": [
    {
      "sku": "TIRE-PILOT-SPORT-4S",
      "quantity": 4,
      "unit_price": 280.50
    }
  ],
  "total_amount": 1122.00
}